171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E ("Fitness" is one of those words that scares people before they even begin. Many imagine expensive gyms, strict diets, protein shakes, and people lifting weights heavier than a motorcycle. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (For many Pakistanis, fitness feels like something reserved for athletes, influencers, or celebrities rather than ordinary people. But the truth is much simpler: fitness is about improving your quality of life through movement, balanced eating, and healthy habits.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 118 0 R
/E (This chapter is designed for people who think they are "too busy," "too old," "too lazy," or "too out of shape" to begin. Through relatable stories, humor, myth-busting, and interactive activities, this chapter aims to prove that fitness doesn't require perfection it requires consistency. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
