/P 136 0 R
/E (It's a fair question. We live in a world where progress is measured by numbers marks on an exam, followers on social media, likes on a post, or kilograms on a weighing scale. Naturally, when people begin exercising, they expect immediate changes. But the truth is that the first results of fitness are rarely visible in the mirror.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [8]
>>
